00:38:58.093 --> 00:39:00.408
You must alter the paradigm

00:39:00.408 --> 00:39:03.178
to achieve the result that you desire.

00:39:03.178 --> 00:39:05.016
Now think about that for a moment.

00:39:05.016 --> 00:39:06.969
You'll see people stuck
